+# Couple Chat UI revisit — screenshot index
+
+Captured 2026-10-17 from `codex/couple-chat-rebuild` (start `33a5a89`, uncommitted working tree).
+
+**Capture method (Android):** Android Robolectric 4.16.1 with native graphics (`@GraphicsMode(NATIVE)`), SDK 35, JVM — the real `SecureChatScreen` + `SecureChatViewModel` fed by `ChatFixtureRepository` (synthetic fixtures in `composeApp/src/commonTest/.../ChatFixtures.kt`). Test: `SecureChatRenderTest`. These are **rendered Compose captures on Android's rendering stack, not an emulator or device**, and not a live Synapse/Django session.
+
+**Viewport:** 390×844 dp at xhdpi (780×1688 px) unless noted; small screen 320×568 dp (640×1136 px). Time zone Asia/Kathmandu. Before = baseline at `33a5a89`; after = this working tree. Same fixture data and dimensions for both.
+
+**Capture method (iOS):** `SecureChatIosRenderTest` — Compose UI test (`runSkikoComposeUiTest`, `ui-test` 1.10.2) executed by `iosSimulatorArm64Test` inside the iPhone 17 Pro simulator (iOS 26.5), rendering the same screen, ViewModel and fixtures through the Compose iOS/Skia runtime at 390×844 dp, scale 2 (780×1688 px). Simulator time zone follows the host. This is a simulator-run render, **not a launched app** and not a UIKit screenshot; no keyboard or safe-area insets are present.
+
