+## Missing platform coverage
+
+- **iOS: 8 states captured on the simulator** (after only; the baseline was not re-rendered on iOS). Initially blocked by a stale CoreSimulatorService (version 1171.7 vs framework 1174.9.2), restarted with the user's approval. Not covered on iOS: launched-app navigation, keyboard, safe areas, live backend.
+- **Android emulator/device: not captured.** No emulator package or AVD is installed.
+- **Live backend:** not exercised; all states come from deterministic fixtures.
